<p>Given the graph of <m>y = f(x)</m> (drawn in blue) and <m>y = g(x)</m> (drawn in red) below, answer all of the following questions.  Express each of your answers
as either a set, such as <em> {2,3,4}</em> (including the set braces),
or using .</p>
<p>(a) Solve <m>f (x) = 0</m>: <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>(b) Solve <m>f (x) \geq 0</m>: <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p>(c) Solve <m>f (x) \lt  0</m>: <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p>(d) Solve <m>f(x) = g(x)</m>: <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
<p>(e) Solve <m>f(x) \leq g(x)</m>: <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0005"/></p>
<p>(f) Solve <m>f(x) &gt; g(x)</m>: <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0006"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left\{-5,0,5\right\}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left[-5,0\right]\cup \left[5,8\right]</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
